- Initial package of gptray 0.1.0:
  * Tray GUI for GlobalProtect-openconnect built on gpservice and gpclient
  * No password prompts: gpservice starts through the packaged polkit policy
  * Built-in SAML window, system browser or password sign-in
  * Remembered sign-in per connection, with "Delete credentials"
